@startuml 13-guide-rag-legs

title Guide DICE - RAG chunks + entity graph from the same ledger (v3)

rectangle "SPDD workflow (your repo)" {
  file "Committed sources\nspdd/canvas/*.md\nspdd/memory/lessons.jsonl" as MD
}

rectangle "Guide (spdd-projection-v3) + Neo4j" {
  database "RAG chunks\nembedding + BM25\n(legs 1-2)" as CH
  database "Domain entities __Entity__\nWorkId, Canvas, Area,\nDecision, Pitfall, Pattern,\nSession, Analysis\ntyped edges (leg 3)" as EN
}

rectangle "Retrieval for the next run" {
  agent "docs_textSearch\ndocs_vectorSearch" as T1
  agent "spdd_workSubgraph\nspdd_areaLessons\nspdd_findByLabel\nspdd_projectionStats\nspdd_getLesson" as T2
}

card "Assembled prompt context\njoin key: Work ID" as CTX

MD --> CH : append-ingest (chunks)
MD --> EN : projection load\n(entities + edges)
CH --> T1
EN --> T2
T1 --> CTX
T2 --> CTX

note bottom of MD
  Effective root descends into
  <root>/sdlc-spdd/ when present.
  Keyless retrieval: local ONNX
  embeddings, no LLM key needed.
end note

@enduml
